    <preface>
      <p>Civil Aviation Amendment (Unmanned Aircraft Levy Collection and Payment) Act 2020</p>
      <p>No. 143, 2020</p>
      <p>An Act to amend the <i>Civil Aviation Act 1988</i>, and for related purposes</p>
      <p>Contents</p>
      <p>1	Short title	1</p>
      <p>2	Commencement	2</p>
